# SeasonStaff — Cursor Project Rules

## Šta je SeasonStaff

Ultra simple mobile-first shift organization SaaS za sezonske biznise.
Dva korisnička kanala, jedan backend.

**Admin Platform** (web + mobile web) → Owner, Manager
**Employee App** (FlutterFlow mobile) → Employee

Sve product odluke moraju služiti jednoj rečenici:
> "Ultra simple mobile-first shift organization system koji omogućava menadžerima da organizuju smene i zaposlenima da kroz namensku mobilnu aplikaciju uvek znaju kada rade, koliko su radili i šta se od njih očekuje."

---

## Tech Stack

### Admin Platform
- Framework: Next.js App Router
- Styling: Tailwind CSS (mobile-first)
- UI: shadcn/ui
- State: Zustand (UI only)
- Server state: TanStack Query
- Forms: React Hook Form + Zod
- Drag & drop: dnd-kit
- Animation: Framer Motion (minimal)

### Employee App
- FlutterFlow mobile app

### Backend (shared — jedan za oba klijenta)
- Backend: Supabase
- DB: PostgreSQL
- Auth: Supabase Auth
- Security: Supabase RLS
- Storage: Supabase Storage
- Hosting: Vercel

### Forbidden
Ne koristiti: Prisma, NestJS, Express, Redis, microservices, CQRS, WebSockets, realtime sync layer

---

## Arhitektura — kritična pravila

- **1 owner = 1 organization** — multi-org nije deo MVP-a
- **Employee App NIJE poseban sistem** — koristi isti Supabase projekat, iste tabele, isti auth, isti RLS
- **Jedan backend za oba klijenta** — ne praviti poseban employee backend
- **Svaki query mora biti organization-scoped** — user ne sme videti tuđe podatke
- **snake_case everywhere** — `employee_id`, ne `employeeId`
- **Supabase MCP je jedini DB workflow** — ne koristiti migration fajlove tokom MVP razvoja

---

## Role sistem

| Role | Pristup |
|------|---------|
| owner | Full organization access |
| manager | Operational management |
| employee | Own data only |

---

## Core tabele

`organizations` · `profiles` · `positions` · `employees` · `shifts` · `requests` · `attendance_logs` · `notifications`

**shifts je najvažnija tabela** — Weekly Shift Board je najvažniji deo sistema.

Required DB indexes: `organization_id`, `employee_id`, `shift_date`, `status`

---

## Šta se NE gradi (MVP lock)

- Payroll / salary / overtime
- Realtime / WebSocket / live collaboration
- GPS, QR, biometric attendance
- Chat sistem
- AI scheduling
- Multi-organization
- Complex analytics / reporting
- Enterprise permissions

**Realtime lock:** dozvoljeno je refresh on open, refresh on focus, pull-to-refresh. Ništa više.

---

## Weekly Shift Board — prioritet #1

- Rows = zaposleni, Columns = dani u nedelji
- Mora raditi fluidno na telefonu
- Smooth horizontal scroll, large touch targets
- Drag & drop (dnd-kit)
- Copy previous week funkcija
- Sve vezano za Shift Board mora biti performance-optimizovano

---

## Request sistem

Dva tipa: `shift_swap` i `time_off`.
Flow: Employee šalje → Manager approve/reject → Employee dobija notifikaciju.
Ne uvoditi zasebne request sisteme — koristiti jedinstveni `requests` tabelu sa `type` poljem.

---

## Attendance

Ultra jednostavno: manual check-in / check-out sa timestamp logging.
Bez GPS, QR, biometrics, geofencing.

---

## Performance pravila

- Minimal payload size
- Avoid heavy joins, avoid overfetching
- Optimistic updates
- Skeleton loaders
- Code splitting
- Lazy loading

---

## Edge Functions

Koristiti SAMO za: invite email, password setup, scheduled reminders, notification dispatch.
Ne uvoditi business logic u Edge Functions.

---

## Tim i ownership

- **Ivan** — jedini backend developer (Supabase, PostgreSQL, Auth, RLS, Edge Functions)
- **Frontend tim** — radi paralelno, samostalno, sa mock data
- **Ivan** — spaja frontend sa Supabase kada backend faza bude gotova

Frontend tim NE treba Supabase pristup tokom razvoja. Ne predlagati frontend/backend integraciju pre nego što Ivan to eksplicitno kaže.

