## Anti-patterns — nikad ne raditi

- Enterprise abstractions
- Unnecessary complexity
- Scope creep
- Feature creep van MVP-a
- Realtime bez validacije potrebe
- Heavy payloads
- Poseban backend za Employee App
- Mešanje admin i employee iskustava

**Simple > clever. Working > scalable. Mobile UX > desktop UX.**
